### LOGIN / REGISTER TEST

### TEST REGISTER
### REGISTER FOR THE FIRST TIME
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "nazir",
    "email": "nazir@gmail.com",
    "password": "123"
}
### REGISTER WITH THE SAME EMAIL
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "nazir123",
    "email": "nazir@gmail.com",
    "password": "123"
}
### REGISTER WITH MESSING FIELDS
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "",
    "email": "nazir@gmail.com",
    "password": "123"
}

### TEST LOGIN
### SUCCESSFUL LOGIN
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "nazir@gmail.com",
    "password": "123"
}
### LOGIN WITH MESSING FIELDS
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "nazir@gmail.com",
    "password": ""
}
### LOGIN WITH WITH EMAIL
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "nazir123@gmail.com",
    "password": "123"
}
### LOGIN WITH WITH PASSWORD
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "nazir@gmail.com",
    "password": "12"
}